Keep a shared board as empty text.
Keep a shared hand as empty text.
Keep a shared symbol as empty text.
Keep a shared newboard as empty text.
Keep a shared newhand as empty text.
Keep a shared bestg as 0.
Keep a shared uniform as 0.
Keep a shared spent as 0.
Keep a shared blank as an empty list of text.
Set bestg to 1000.
To score.
If spent is less than bestg, set bestg to spent.

To attach from atspot (a whole number).
The parts is an empty list of text.
The finish is one more than the last position of board.
The head is the slice of board from 0 to atspot.
The tail is the slice of board from atspot to finish.
Place head into parts.
Place symbol into parts.
Place tail into parts.
Set newboard to join parts with "".

To cut from spot (a whole number).
The parts is an empty list of text.
The finish is one more than the last position of hand.
The head is the slice of hand from 0 to spot.
The tail is the slice of hand from spot plus 1 to finish.
Place head into parts.
Place tail into parts.
Set newhand to join parts with "".

To verify from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of board, return.
The base is the slice of board from 0 to 1.
The here is the slice of board from spot to spot plus 1.
If here does not match base, set uniform to 0.
Verify from spot plus 1.

To relax.
If the last position of board is less than 2, return.
Set uniform to 1.
Verify from 1.
If uniform is 1, Set board to join blank with "".

To seek from h (a whole number) with p (a whole number).
If spent is at least bestg, return.
If the last position of board is less than 0, score, return.
If h is more than the last position of hand, return.
The final is one more than the last position of board.
If p is more than final, seek from h plus 1 with 0, return.
The savedboard is a copy of board.
The savedhand is a copy of hand.
Set symbol to the slice of hand from h to h plus 1.
Attach from p.
Cut from h.
Set board to newboard.
Set hand to newhand.
Relax.
Set spent to spent plus 1.
Seek from 0 with 0.
Set spent to spent minus 1.
Set board to savedboard.
Set hand to savedhand.
Seek from h with p plus 1.

Place "G" into board.
Place "GGGGG" into hand.
Seek from 0 with 0.
If bestg is 1000, show -1, otherwise show bestg.
